{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bone_boulder","model_identifier":"bone_boulder","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bone_boulder\n\nBone boulder: a lump of fused bones and skulls about 50 cm (18 u) across, torn off a giant skeleton and thrown at walls and towers.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -10..11, y -8..8, z -13..12 units (0.60 x 0.47 x 0.69 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 26.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 21 x 17 x 25 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z -1\n\n## Notes\n\n- Projectile: origin at its centre, point (direction of flight) along -Z. No animation; the game moves and spins it.\n- Spin it in flight; it shatters on impact (break effect from the game).\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"mass","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-8.0,-4.8,-4.8],"to":[8.0,4.8,4.8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10.0,0.2,26.0,9.8],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.2,16.2,9.8,25.8],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10.0,0.2,26.0,9.8],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.2,16.2,9.8,25.8],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10.0,0.2,26.0,9.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10.0,0.2,26.0,9.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f3b20ce0-eb38-53ca-b64c-d932bab6e3cc"},{"name":"mass_y","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.8,-8.0,-4.8],"to":[4.8,8.0,4.8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.2,0.0,9.8,16.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.2,0.0